          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We analysed some situations, asked questions, and found answers by first guessing, then modelling the problem statement, followed by making assumptions and approximations to carry out the calculations."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.217,
            0.823,
            0.257
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We experienced how rapid exponential growth, also called multiplicative growth, can be compared to additive growth."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.27,
            0.821,
            0.296
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "n ^ { a }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "n \\times n \\times n \\times n \\times \\ldots \\times n"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (n multiplied by itself a times) and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "n ^ { - a }   =   \\frac { 1 } { n ^ { a } } ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.302,
            0.546,
            0.323
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Operations with exponents satisfy"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
